control: A write of a sealed value by a deployable is a compare-and-set on the bytes it last knew
removes: the write-back's statement no longer compares the stored bytes, so it replaces whatever the row holds
packages: ./executioncontext/accountload
tests: TestAStaleWriteBackIsRefusedAndTheStoredCredentialUsed TestAStaleReSealIsRefused
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

